# Rayt Me

Portable verified professional reputation. Company **RAYTME LLC**. Live site **raytme.me**, API **api.raytme.me**. App ids `me.rate.rayt`. English controls legal text.

The website sells, hosts accounts, and shows a public card. Only the Expo app submits ratings and opens a professional snapshot. `/p/:id` is card-only.

Full map: `docs/PROJECT-INDEX.md`.

